  },
  "question": {
    "text": "A satellite is revolving in a circular orbit at a height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi></math> from the earth's surface, such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>R</mi></math> where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;is the radius of the earth. Assuming that the effect of the earth's atmosphere can be neglected. What should be the minimum change required in the speed so that the satellite could escape from the gravitational field of earth?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Orbital velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>Velocity required to escape the gravitational field,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>Change in velocity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>GM</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mi>GM</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mi>R</mi></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mi>g</mi><mi>R</mi></msqrt></math></p>"
  }
